<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell EPS view upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell EPS view upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its estimates for Dell Computer Corp's earnings per share (EPS), a source at the firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The firm raised its estimate for Dell's fourth-quarter 1996 EPS to $1.75 from $1.36, the fiscal 1997 EPS to $5.30 from $4.50 and the fiscal 1998 EPS to $6.25 from $5.25.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
